040","name":"CWF美術部","detail":"背景","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:127587","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"TxT","creatorId":"vndb:s4149","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4149","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4149","name":"TxT","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:96013","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"TxT","creatorId":"vndb:s4149","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4149","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4149","name":"TxT","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:96014","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c18868","characterName":"秋ヶ瀬 希美","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"13678","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"21704"}],"egsCharacterIds":["9896"],"vndbCharacterId":"c18868"},"originalCharacterName":"秋ヶ瀬 希美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"81"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"156"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"83"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist's classmate and the discipline committee chairman. Forthright and serious, and as the chairman, she also has natural arrogance. But despite all that, she still has an interest in love as with all girls her age. Once she decides on the guy she wants, she will wholeheartedly try to win him over. She will not listen to the protagonist as she sees him as an eyesore."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c18868"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園の風紀を乱す輩を許さない、生真面目ツンツン風紀委員。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夕也の銀髪を不良の証として、染め直すよう注意しまくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実は恋愛に憧れており、一度ときめいたらとことん一途に。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9896","sourceWorkId":"15852","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"風紀委員に命をかけるツンツン娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"きびきびとした生真面目な性格で、風紀委員長としてなめられないように偉そうな態度をとっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、年相応に恋に憧れる乙女でもあり、一度ときめいたらとことん一途なタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヤンチャな外見の夕也を目の敵にしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"地毛と知っても、学園の風紀を乱す輩は許さない！ と、まだ注意する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「その髪の色は校則違反です！　風祭君、すぐに染め直しなさい！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"13678"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3c/3c6e60906031194f9e55c0969aaac136f23fa752a239f3771f63533d1cd76d90.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8d/8dc12d3cfc4a977d060b5a2da218e815e31786fc63a048204a7a896ce0b95f31.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c18869","characterName":"神城 優樹菜","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"13675","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"21704"}],"egsCharacterIds":["9897"],"vndbCharacterId":"c18869"},"originalCharacterName":"神城 優樹菜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"79"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"152"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"80"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"52"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A strange girl that appears on campus at nighttime. Always doing what she wants, quiet and emotionless girl, no one knows what is in her heart and mind. Sometimes she will show a stupid side that leaves people speechless. Clear about her likes and dislikes, if she likes something then she likes it, if she hates something she will express her disgust. She claims to be the protagonist's wife."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c18869"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"夕也と同じ銀色の髪を持つ少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夕也の嫁を自称する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"口数は少ないが、好きなものは好き、嫌いなものは嫌いと意思表示をハッキリ言う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"時折、不思議なボケをする。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9897","sourceWorkId":"15852","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"夕方の学園でだけ出会う不思議少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常にマイペース、無口・無表情で、何を考えているのか分からない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"時折、不思議なボケをすることも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"意思表示はハッキリしており、好きなものは好き、嫌いなものは嫌い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なぜか出会った時から好感度が高く、夕也の嫁を自称する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「……わたくしは、あなた様の嫁です。」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"13675"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bb/bb95d54d3c69ec77b14066d31d1792e7201a9ace3107a7f82fd36184c38b7cfc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/02/02108fd522e26d8163bca46243ba7006fb552a8945dfe99c1dc0c3cb473043d2.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c18870","characterName":"春野 かえで","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"13676","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"21704"}],"egsCharacterIds":["9898"],"vndbCharacterId":"c18870"},"originalCharacterName":"春野 かえで","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"85"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"155"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"87"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Younger of the Haruno twin sisters. Energetic and innocent, a liberal girl that don't cower. Although she sometimes acts recklessly, she is always thinking about her sister. She has good mobility and wide communication."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c18870"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"青女町名物双子の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"物怖じしないフリーダムな性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉につっこまれるのが好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"※ボケとツッコミ的な意味で。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9898","sourceWorkId":"15852","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"青女町名物の双子の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元気ハツラツで無邪気。物怖じしないフリーダムな性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自由すぎるボケ担当。振り回しがちだけど、なんだかんだで姉のことは好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"フットワークが軽く、顔が広い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ときどき、呼ばれてもいないのに勝手に出てくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「青女町名物美少女双子、美少女担当の春野かえでです！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"13676"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cd/cd16471c767774bd33dad6633b472d1ed79b5ed17d9717a3c9336358f6acffe0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e0/e074df39444e358f80f3ac29ccab60729743b0ffdfec0be04c3899bd9f914f39.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c18871","characterName":"春野 さくら","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"13679","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"21704"}],"egsCharacterIds":["9899"],"vndbCharacterId":"c18871"},"originalCharacterName":"春野 さくら","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"77"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"155"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"79"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"52"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Elder of the Haruno twin sisters. Serious and cautious girl, she sometimes has a tendency to hesitate. While sometimes she finds Kaede to be a bit frustrating, but in the end she still loves her sister very much. Compared to her sister, her body is still developing. Compared to the other girls in the story, she is regarded as the most normal."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c18871"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"青女町名物双子の姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"やや引っ込み思案な性格だが、ツッコミをする時はハキハキしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"妹と比べると発展途上な体つきなのが、悩みの種。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9899","sourceWorkId":"15852","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"青女町名物の双子の姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"丁寧で優しげな物腰。やや引っ込み思案な性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ツッコミ担当で、ツッコミをする時はハキハキしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"振り回されがちだけど、なんだかんだで妹のことは好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"妹のかえでと比べると発展途上な身体つきで、けっこう気にしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"変わり者が多いヒロインの中で、貴重な常識人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あ、え？　ふ、双子担当？ の、春野さくら、です」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"13679"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cc/cc3abe46cf400c485f0ee9c3d30113a3b09bb242289f2cbe4fb567fa36304a08.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/99/99e1a0a33ab89c6ace287ef736ba50a335b55df840c5378e481a7754ee9e7bf8.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"com